---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Vol.01 P4｜Technology｜J 的世界 Research">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P4</div>
    <h1>從晶片走向系統</h1>
    <p>AI Platform 的六個連續技術節點。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">TECHNOLOGY PATH</div>
      <h2>六個節點</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">01</span>
      <h3>AI Compute</h3>
      <p>GPU、ASIC 與 AI 加速器提供核心運算能力。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">02</span>
      <h3>Advanced Process</h3>
      <p>先進邏輯製程持續提升效能、密度與能源效率。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">03</span>
      <h3>Advanced Packaging</h3>
      <p>透過 2.5D、3D 與異質整合提高系統整合能力。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">04</span>
      <h3>Optical Interconnect</h3>
      <p>高速光互連支撐日益龐大的資料傳輸需求。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">05</span>
      <h3>Thermal / Power</h3>
      <p>高功耗 AI 系統對散熱與電力提出更高要求。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">06</span>
      <h3>System</h3>
      <p>最終回到整個 AI 系統的效能、功耗與成本。</p>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature">
  <div class="section">
    <article class="map-card">
      <div class="map-flow">
        <span>AI Compute</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Advanced Process</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Advanced Packaging</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Optical Interconnect</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Thermal / Power</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>System</span>
      </div>

      <p>
        研究重點不是預測哪一項技術一定會取代另一項技術，
        而是追蹤每一個節點何時由技術可能性，
        進入驗證、導入與量產。
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <article class="card">
    <span class="tag">RESEARCH METHOD</span>
    <h3>技術成熟度，比題材熱度更重要。</h3>
    <p>
      後續公司研究將以 Production、
      Qualification、Development 與 Inference
      分層追蹤。
    </p>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="cta-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">NEXT · P5</div>
      <h2>Glass Core：結果，而不是起點。</h2>
      <p>把玻璃基板放回 AI 封裝的完整技術路徑。</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button" href="/research/vol01/p5">閱讀 P5 →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .map-flow {
    padding:18px;
    border:1px solid #2b394a;
    border-radius:12px;
    background:#0b1119;
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    color:#d9e2ec;
  }

  .map-flow span {
    padding:5px 8px;
    border:1px solid #354457;
    border-radius:6px;
    background:#121c28;
    font-size:13px;
  }

  .map-flow b {
    color:#7188a0;
  }

  @media(max-width:800px) {
    .map-flow b { display:none; }
  }
</style>

</BaseLayout>
